    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A comprehensive insurance policy is compulsory. This includes the standard third‑party coverage as well as the 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance, which safeguards the vehicle against any loss or damage during road‑and‑sea transit. The policy document must be current, display the insurer’s logo, policy number, and coverage limits.</p>
