    <span>It must also bear the IBA (Indian Logistics Association) approval stamp to be recognized by regulatory authorities</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Collecting and presenting these documents in a tidy, organized manner not only speeds up verification at checkpoints but also protects your investment. Remember, the <strong>100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance</strong> offers complete financial coverage, giving you peace of mind that your bike is protected throughout its journey, whether it travels by road or via sea routes.</p></div>
